1. The following employees are exempt from the overtime provisions of Ark. Code Ann. § 11-4-211(a):

a. any employee of an agricultural employer;

b. any employee with respect to who the U.S. Secretary of Transportation has power to establish qualifications and maximum hours of service pursuant to 49 U.S.C. 31502;

